{"id":"c5ebccd4a58a882422b913da87df1cf941e21a03","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1257520","title":"Codex 大家会开 Full access 么","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"wangrqt196","excerpt":"OpenAI - @wangrqt196 - 一共就三个选项Ask for approval 基本没啥用，鸡毛蒜头都要蹦弹窗。Approve for me 用过一阵子，整体还行，涉及一些工具调用还是要蹦弹窗确认。Full acces","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>一共就三个选项\nAsk for approval 基本没啥用，鸡毛蒜头都要蹦弹窗。\nApprove for me 用过一阵子，整体还行，涉及一些工具调用还是要蹦弹窗确认。\nFull acces 最近开了一阵子，感觉没啥问题，但总感觉心里有点儿慌。</p>\n<p>有朋友遇到过啥 bug 么？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296339\" data-reply-id=\"18296339\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/772b9e18edcaf3884d40e6132d20fb7e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ty29022\" data-uid=\"575018\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>丝毫不慌，开发机器格式化了又能怎样<br>```<br>claude --dangerously-skip-permissions<br>agy --dangerously-skip-permissions<br>codex --yolo<br>```</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296346\" data-reply-id=\"18296346\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7afa30533f52b94fb67e8bdd90655b38?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wangrqt196\" data-uid=\"236201\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>2</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/ty29022\">ty29022</a> 学到了， yolo 刚搜了一下，这名字起的真好！。</p><p>我现在开 Full access 前提，是模型选了 GPT-6 Astra Extra High，别的模型都不太敢</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296348\" data-reply-id=\"18296348\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a9a0/8061/678150_normal.png?m=1794832659\" alt=\"greyxx\" data-uid=\"678150\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>3</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>为啥我的 Full acces ，还是会弹窗</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296349\" data-reply-id=\"18296349\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f22/feff/383743_normal.png?m=1793162364\" alt=\"YanSeven\" data-uid=\"383743\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>full access 当然要开，不开这种模式这个工具就没有意义了，我是在 vm 中使用的，专门给它一个 vm，数据及时本地备份+push github，完全无需担心。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296350\" data-reply-id=\"18296350\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c23f/3436/181676_normal.png?m=1794658838\" alt=\"MuyuQ\" data-uid=\"181676\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>5</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/wangrqt196\">wangrqt196</a> 你模型选的越聪明，越能给你整一个大活儿。  luna terra 之类的你就算开了，还会被内置的策略拦截。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296359\" data-reply-id=\"18296359\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7afa30533f52b94fb67e8bdd90655b38?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"wangrqt196\" data-uid=\"236201\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/MuyuQ\">MuyuQ</a> 是这样的，我用 Astra 用了好几周才磨合好，刚开始用，天天给我塞私货，能把人气死。</p><p>不过我整体的体验，聪明的