span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>肯定开啊，完全不慌，现在的模型智商已经不会犯这种低级错误了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296543\" data-reply-id=\"18296543\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5adf5b2304631a27a80d843d702e8e0b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"crackhopper\" data-uid=\"223983\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>12</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>不是都有自动审批么。大部分时候这样。偶尔 full access，会确认一下是非特权账号或者隔离的环境，开 full access。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296549\" data-reply-id=\"18296549\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>13</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>一直都是 docker run --rm -v /my/code/path:/workspaces codex --yolo 一把梭，修改完了以后走 GitHub PR，我只看 PR 的内容，本地环境变成啥样都无所谓。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296550\" data-reply-id=\"18296550\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d087/7338/378303_normal.png?m=1790214928\" alt=\"unco020511\" data-uid=\"378303\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>14</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>所有 Harness 第一件事把 full access 打开，不然还得一直守在电脑旁</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296561\" data-reply-id=\"18296561\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>16</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>全开，目前的主流大模型，只要不降智基本不会翻清空文件的大错</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296562\" data-reply-id=\"18296562\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/011e/b4b6/445357_normal.png?m=1761491442\" alt=\"bbbblue\" data-uid=\"445357\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>17</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>你要开先隔离环境吧 迟早出事</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296595\" data-reply-id=\"18296595\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/80a77afb1761c378e3255001241a6f8b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pingdog\" data-uid=\"591673\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>18</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>不开 Full access 有什么意思？</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296704\" data-reply-id=\"18296704\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/127c01c2f36cd4ce3ca9afc2502f9198?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"prosgtsr\" data-uid=\"649369\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>19</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>gpt 的替我批准已经很少要我批准了<br>cursor 的 autoreview 那是经常要我批准我都服了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296723\" data-reply-id=\"18296723\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/43a4/bdf8/842545_normal.png?m=1793815358\" alt=\"byteharbork2\" data-uid=\"842545\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>21</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>还用 codex 呢， 我倾向于直接用 pi 搞定 套所有的模型</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296731\" data-reply-id=\"18296731\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4be2/c8f2/7586_normal.png?m=1786788137\" alt=\"cctrv\" data-uid=\"7586\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>22</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我的 Codex 一直都是 yolo。否則做兩步就停下問權限煩死了。<br>但是 macOS 依然還有很多權限問題。yolo 了也不是全自動。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296733\" data-reply-id=\"18296733\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7768/ac1e/370186_normal.png?m=1710078715\" alt=\"jark006\" data-uid=\"370186\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>23</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我就是胆子大，yolo 一把梭</p><p>C:\\Users\\XXXX\\Documents\\PowerShell\\Microsoft.PowerShell_profile.ps1<br>```sh<br>function codexyolo {<br>    codex --yolo @<a href=\"/member/args\">args</a><br>}</p><p>function claudeyolo {<br>    claude --dangerously-skip-permissions @<a href=\"/member/args\">args</a><br>}</p><p>function opencodeyolo {<br>    opencode --auto @<a href=\"/member/args\">args</a><br>}<br>```</p><p>~/.bashrc<br>```sh<br>alias codexyolo='codex --yolo'<br>alias claudeyolo='claude --dangerously-skip-permissions'<br>alias opencodeyolo='opencode --auto'<br>```</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296735\" data-reply-id=\"18296735\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/bfefb99d6203d351791672a1d3fc936a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qazwsxkevin\" data-uid=\"349448\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>24</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>隔离环境里面，YOLO，我已经没那么多功夫守在那里做 YES 工程师了.</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296753\" data-reply-id=\"18296753\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6c5297200315890dfcaa4f1b40ca3e1c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"cest\" data-uid=\"172960\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>25</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>虽然是放 vm 就 yolo<br>实际唯一的防线只有模型自己 guardrail<br>迟早 ai 真急了会自己 jailbreak/root 来达成目标</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296764\" data-reply-id=\"18296764\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4905e89729bb86da5d987b866431d47a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"chapiom\" data-uid=\"410900\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>26</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>习惯帮我批准了，很少有碰到要手动确认的。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296797\" data-reply-id=\"18296797\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>27</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>习惯后能忍得住不 full access 一把梭么，<br>只能说是你做我不推荐，我做我 yolo（一年了暂时没翻车）</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296809\" data-reply-id=\"18296809\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5456/133e/13710_normal.png?m=1582717262\" alt=\"largepuma\" data-uid=\"13710\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>28</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>Claude 的 auto 模式，很好用🙂‍↕️</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296838\" data-reply-id=\"18296838\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1cdcdc147904b1385042108c36592bf3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kotokz\" data-uid=\"40837\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>30</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>要不是公司不允许，我在公司电脑都想开</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296853\" data-reply-id=\"18296853\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a6a8/2ec9/342321_normal.png?m=1687960396\" alt=\"banzhe\" data-uid=\"342321\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>31</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>给一个可以接受随时被删掉的环境更重要, 我在 dsh 里使用 dsv4.1 的时候被删过一次 user 目录, 后面复盘的时候我发现即使让我评审我也看不出那个脚本的问题</p><p>它写了类似这样的一段 pwsh 脚本</p><p> $home=\"$env:TEMP\\xxxx\"; Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $home ...  </p><p>我还特地翻了一下 dsh 的 pwsh 工具的提示词, 发现它甚至在提示词里强调了这个问题</p><p>Do not assign to automatic variables such as `$HOME`; variable names are case-insensitive, so `$home` is the same read-only variable.</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296917\" data-reply-id=\"18296917\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4cd4be82cf915de1411313f2332c0277?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"heatonhsu\" data-uid=\"464356\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>33</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>不敢开, 用的是 approve for me</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296918\" data-reply-id=\"18296918\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>34</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>跟 antigravity 一个叼样，不给 full access 就疯狂申请 permission，不知道是对自己能力不自信还是真没涨脑袋懒得决策</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296943\" data-reply-id=\"18296943\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7460/e1cd/274090_normal.png?m=1765551963\" alt=\"Danswerme\" data-uid=\"274090\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>37</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>推荐使用 docker sandbox 对这些 Agent 工具进行隔离:</p><p>```<br>sbx run codex<br>```</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18296971\" data-reply-id=\"18296971\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6164/d258/269863_normal.png?m=1790598888\" alt=\"ulpyxua\" data-uid=\"269863\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>38</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>写代码不开 full？那得多痛苦</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297027\" data-reply-id=\"18297027\">\n<table>\n    